{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "All in the Stars"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The First Conditional: Possibilities, Superstitions, Warnings and Threats"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the first conditional to talk about a result that is likely to happen or is almost certain to happen in the future IF the condition in the <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause occurs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The form of the first conditional is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If</span> + simple present, will + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the first conditional to talk about "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li><span class=\"underline\">Possibilities </span>in the present or future</li>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">You'll miss the bus if you don't hurry!</span><br/> <br/> <li><span class=\"underline\">Superstitions</span></li>For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If you rub a rabbit's foot, it will bring you good luck!</span> <br/> <br/><li><span class=\"underline\">Warnings and Threats</span></li>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">If you don't come to my wedding, I'll never speak to you again.</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">If you do that again, I will hurt you!</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If Mercury is in retrograde, your computer will malfunction."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you try to plan any travel, there will be interruptions and delays."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If the retrograde happens during your astrological star sign, you will feel the effects of the retrograde more intensely than most people. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If your horoscope tells you to do something or avoid something, will you follow these commands?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you spend some time studying your sign and your own personality and relationships, you will see that there is some merit to astrology. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "careful due to lack of trust or uncertainty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  If it's just a small purchase, you can be less wary."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about technology and beliefs."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interruption"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when something \u200bstops another thing from \u200bhappening for a \u200bshort \u200bperiod"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you try to plan any travel, there will be interruptions and delays."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "validity"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "truth; logically or factually sound"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really think there is validity to it."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "astrology"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "study of the \u200bmovements and \u200bpositions of the \u200bsun, \u200bmoon, \u200bplanets, and \u200bstars in the \u200bbelief that they \u200binfluence \u200bhuman \u200bbehavior"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I never expected you to know so much about astrology."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "delay"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "period of time where something does not happen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are always a lot of delays on the trains."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "purchase"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "item obtained with an exchange of money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  If you need to make any big purchases, like a car or house, you shouldn't make them during this time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "horoscope"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bdescription of what is going to \u200bhappen to you, \u200bbased on the \u200bposition of the \u200bstars and \u200bplanets at the \u200btime of \u200byour \u200bbirth"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you read your horoscope every day?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "daily"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "every day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't read the daily horoscopes but I believe that your birth date influences your behavior and personality traits."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Modals in the Result Clause"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you use the first conditional, you can choose to use modals in the result clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a modal in the result clause, you want to communicate an offer or make a suggestion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If you get a new job, you <span class=\"strong\">should </span>have a party!</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">My sister <span class=\"strong\">can </span>get us tickets to the concert if you want to go.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at some other examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you have to travel during Mercury retrograde, you should give yourself plenty of time and have a back-up plan."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you need to make any big purchases, like a car or house, you shouldn't make them during this time."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If it's just a small purchase, you can be less wary."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you need to sign any legal documents or contracts, you ought to wait until the retrograde is over. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you pay attention to when you have problems, you will see that there is a pattern."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Watch the TED Talk: <span class=\"italic\">Why People Believe Weird Things</span> (Michael Shermer)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes while you listen. Listen as many times as you need."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down any new vocabulary you hear. Look up the meanings of the new words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Summarize your notes and write a paragraph about what you heard in the video."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your paragraph to your class or group."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I watch a TED Talk video and take notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I look up new vocabulary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I summarize my notes and write a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my paragraph to my group."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow, Peter, I never expected you to know so much about astrology.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ever since I started reading about Mercury retrograde, I've come to believe in it more and more. I really think there is validity to it. I can give you personal examples. If Mercury is in retrograde, your computer will malfunction. That has happened to me several times. If you try to plan any travel, there will be interruptions and delays. If you have to travel during Mercury retrograde, you should give yourself plenty of time and have a back-up plan.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You said Mercury retrograde also affects our minds.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. If you need to make any big purchases, like a car or house, you shouldn't make them during this time. If it's just a small purchase, you can be less wary. If you need to sign any legal documents or contracts, you ought to wait until the retrograde is over. Essentially you shouldn't do or start anything new. It's a time for reconnecting with what you already have. If the retrograde happens during your astrological star sign, you will feel the effects of the retrograde more intensely than most people.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't tell me you believe in star signs too? Do you read your horoscope every day? And if your horoscope tells you to do something or avoid something, will you follow these commands?", "id": 2, "time": "36000", "image": "engenn10le17ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I don't read the daily horoscopes but I believe that your birth date influences your behavior and personality traits. If you spend some time studying your sign and your own personality and relationships, you will see that there is some merit to astrology.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know, Peter. I can't believe that there are only 12 types of people in this world. Does that mean I'm the same as every other Taurus?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: At least consider Mercury retrograde. If you pay attention to when you have problems, you will see that there is a pattern.", "id": 3, "time": "81000", "image": "engenn10le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express opinions and beliefs about the solution to a problem."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express that a fairly certain condition will be fulfilled."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you know anyone who believes something that you think is strange? What is it?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What kinds of things do you believe that others might think are strange or untrue?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_typ